{
  "id": "request-output-prefix",
  "goals": [
    "dataOut B u (windows (reqTrace B tick s0 σ) n) <+: outBytes mach m0 (decode kin (dataIn B u (windows (reqTrace B tick s0 σ) n))).recs",
    "frameTick u kin kout mach (abs s) v = (abs (tick s v).1, (tick s v).2)",
    "dataOut bus reg w <+: crcReplies (dataIn bus reg w)",
    "recs.flatMap recordBytes = bs.take (8 * kin * (bs.length / (8 * kin)))",
    "the bytes that a request program writes to a UART as a prefix of a specification's output",
    "dataOut B u (windows (reqTrace B tick s0 σ) n) <+: (delimAnswers mach maxLen m0 ((dataIn B u (windows (reqTrace B tick s0 σ) n)).map UInt64.toUInt8)).map UInt8.toUInt64",
    "delimTick u maxLen mach (abs s) v = (abs (tick s v).1, (tick s v).2) on the states of an invariant",
    "cobsDecode s = some r ↔ cobsEncode r = s",
    "the answers of a request program to records delimited by zero bytes"
  ],
